WEBVTT

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Wow!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.220
There are so many stores!

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.000
Everyone's wearing fancy clothes,

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:30.000
eating sweet things, and going on dates.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.210
So this is the city.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:35.790
It's a wonderful place just like what I read in manga.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:38.260
Please do not forget, Tsubasa-sama.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:43.210
Our target is the swordsman of the Ukiha-Kamikaze style,

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.890
Karasuma Yoichi.

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:47.740
He is the man you must defeat.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.010
Aren't you excited, Tsubasa-sama?

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:57.960
Our Tsubame-Benten style, which has been hidden in the shadows, will finally be brought into the light.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.180
An amazing art of substitution.

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.540
Tsubame Tsubasa, you truly are the next head of the Tsubame family.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.060
Tsubasa-sama is serious!

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:24.910
It doesn't matter when

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:24.910
itsudemo donna toki mo

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:30.340
I always think of your smile

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:30.340
omoidasu no wa kimi no egao de

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:35.810
The single word that I couldn't say

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:35.810
mada sono tada hitokoto

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:41.010
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:41.010
kimi ni mo tsutae dainda zutto

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:44.490
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:44.490
ima wa fureoi inotteta

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:47.230
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:47.230
kumo wo tsuuka mienai

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:51.980
In front of you, I swear that

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:51.980
mae ni chikatta toshitemo

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:54.840
I will always be your side

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:54.840
koko ni iru yo

00:01:54.550 --> 00:02:01.720
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:54.550 --> 00:02:01.720
bokura no mezasu mirai wa mada mada tooku

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.280
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.280
hateshi naitteto

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:10.950
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:10.950
namida no sonowake ga aru kagiri

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:15.810
I will not stop moving towards it

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:15.810
massugu aruite yukou

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:25.740
As usual, we'll be together today

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:21.840
bokutachi wa nani mo kawarazu ni

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:25.740
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:31.190
In the same world

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:31.190
onaji kono sekai ni ite

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:46.450
The Third Longsword

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:46.450
It's Amazing When You Take It Off

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:58.560
There, the morning dojo cleaning's done.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.860
It has become so clean.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:05.580
I'm so happy you're helping, Ayame.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.580
I am as well.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.990
You've been showing up for training lately, too.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.670
Why the sudden turn of events?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.950
Shut up!

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.830
Nothing's up with me!

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:21.180
You're up against a tough foe, Ayame-nee.

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:22.930
Huh?

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.590
What are you talking about?

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:26.390
It's too late to hide it.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:30.280
Ibuki-nee and Yoichi-tsan are in the same class at school,

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.720
so you're at a complete disadvantage.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:37.190
That's why I think you should at least be with him at the dojo.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.220
That's true-

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.780
Eh, what am I saying?!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:45.080
Good luck, Ayame-nee.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:53.040
Even if you say so, what am I supposed to do?

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.290
Oh, is something wrong, Ayame-dono?

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.340
Huh?

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:07.830
Oh, a full-speed dash right after cleaning?

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.220
I must train myself, too.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:13.230
Ayame?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.680
Today, we have another transfer student.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:21.990
Come on in.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.130
I-I'm Tsubame Tsubasa.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.790
Nice to meet you all.

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:36.900
Whoa!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.910
It's a girl!

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:38.170
Damn, she's cute.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.340
She's so small.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.470
She's a cute little girl.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.480
Wh-Why?

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.470
You're drooling over her.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.300
Tsubasa-sama.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.980
I want to attend that school!

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.210
I see!

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:09.090
You'll close in as a friend,

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:11.240
and back stab him when you see the chance?

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.960
S-Something like that...

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:16.000
What a great plan, Tsubasa-sama.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:21.720
}The introverted Tsubasa-sama has taken the initiative for the first time.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:26.350
I, Takatsukasa Angela, am so fortunate to see your growth.

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:29.010
Let us defeat that Karasuma Yoichi!

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.770
It's all in order to achieve our, and the Tsubame-Benten style's, greatest goal.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:36.140
So that's...

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.280
Karasuma Yoichi.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.940
Yes, Tsubasa-sama.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.440
No matter what, that man...

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:45.950
That man absolutely...

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.240
must be defeated!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.940
mustn't be defeated!

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:52.850
If I defeat him, my mission will be complete.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:54.780
Then I won't be able to stay here.

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:58.460
Just for a little while, I'd like to live a normal life.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:03.000
I should stay away from him as much as possible.

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:13.760
Nice to meet you, Tsubame-san.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.640
Let's be good friends.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.960
So this is school.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.660
The normal life I even dreamed of.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:25.500
I'm finally a normal girl.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.650
Tsubame-san,

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:30.910
what school did you attend before you came here?

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.530
What do your parents do?

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:34.820
Where do you live?

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:35.700
What's your hobby?

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:37.960
I can't say...

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:40.250
I can't possibly say that...

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:44.340
my entire family has been deep in the mountains, devoting themselves to martial arts.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.420
I definitely can't say that.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:49.540
Oh, did we ask you something we shouldn't have?

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.220
What's your favorite TV show?

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.720
TVs are bad!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.730
What type of music do you like?

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:01.230
Music is bad!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:03.150
Do you have a favorite snack?

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:05.030
This berry is edible.

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:06.650
It's so good.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.870
Umm...

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.800
Hey, no soccer in the classroom!

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.660
Oh, come on, Class President.

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.120
Huh? What is it, everyone?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:29.990
Oh, no.

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.510
My body moved on its own.

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:42.800
A normal life is impossible for me...

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.900
That was quite impressive.

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:51.240
For you to slice a ball without the slightest look,

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:54.410
what sort of training have you undergone?

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:57.110
Karasuma Yoichi...

00:07:57.110 --> 00:08:01.410
I'm quite new at this school like you,

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.920
but school is truly an interesting place.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.870
Isn't that right, everyone?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.340
Why are you sweet-talking her?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:15.090
You guys shouldn't bombard her with so many questions, either.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:16.850
I'm sorry.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:20.290
They all just wanted to get to know you, Tsubame-san.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:23.280
I'm the Class President, Ikaruga Ibuki.

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.180
Nice to meet you.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:27.610
I go by the name of Karasuma Yoichi.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.680
Glad to meet you, Tsubame-dono.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:32.210
Nice to meet you.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.940
I hope we can get along.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.080
Amazing.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:40.290
She got close to him with his guard completely down.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.620
Splendid job, Tsubasa-sama.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:45.000
All that remains is for you to defeat him.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.880
You're doing very well, Tsubasa-sama.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:54.880
He's like a sitting duck.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.890
You can defeat him at any time.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.890
Now's your chance!

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.890
Strike at Karasuma!

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.690
G-Goodbye.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.240
See you tomorrow.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:09.400
Bye bye.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.690
School was fun.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.670
I can't wait for tomorrow.

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:23.510
Oww!

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:26.160
I lowered my guard...

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.040
Hey, kid.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.510
Where were you looking?

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:37.510
C-Could he be what they call a delinquent?

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.480
Am I being picked on?

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:41.890
What's that?

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.470
Where's your apology, shortie?!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:49.210
You a new student?

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:51.300
You're probably not used to things around here,

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:52.570
but be careful.

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:57.640
Huh? Wait, hold on.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.150
Wassan, you're being awfully nice.

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:01.570
Shut your mouth, Torigaya!

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:03.530
I just woke up and my head hurts.

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:04.760
Normal!

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:07.900
It's a normal scene that happens all the time at school.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.790
Watch where you go, little girl.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.890
Even though he looks a little scary,

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:14.700
he was actually nice.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:15.600
Huh?

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.550
What am I feeling?

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:21.050
Tsubasa-sama, you're doing well on your mission.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:22.380
A-Angie!

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.320
How did it go with Karasuma?

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:26.070
Well...

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.800
I thought I'd fight him when I find the chance.

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.060
Tsubasa-sama!

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:32.220
Why do you think we've come all this way?

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:34.860
You haven't forgotten our main objective, right?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:40.800
Though we've been working in the shadows, the Tsubame-Benten style is nearing its end.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:44.370
In order to revive it, we need the funds no matter what.

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:49.790
Target is this man, Karasuma Yoichi.

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.630
The reward is just as you see.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.310
Furthermore, I'll sponsor the Tsubame-Benten style.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:57.880
I will assist you in reviving your style.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.630
Now is the time to fight, Tsubasa-sama,

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.560
as the next head of the Tsubame family,

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.140
as a martial artist!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.400
Tsu-Tsubasa-sama...

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.310
Amazing art of substitution as always.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:10.430
I shouldn't be impressed!

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.790
Come back!

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:14.200
I've finally become the high school student I've always wished to be.

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.560
I finally have friends for the first time too.

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:18.440
Now I have to fight my friends

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:22.620
I never wanted to be a martial artist!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.370
Well, well, Tsubasa-dono.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.440
Karasuma-kun.

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:28.000
Do you want to go home together?

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.080
Tsubasa-sama!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.000
Forgive me!

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:56.230
If you cannot understand through words, this is the only other way.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:02.240
Karasuma, I request a match between you and Tsubasa-sama, the next head of Tsubame-Benten style!

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.490
What are you thinking, doing something like that out of nowhere?!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.560
What does she mean by a match, Tsubasa-dono?

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:10.700
But before that, your clothes.

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:16.440
This uniform is... heavy.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:19.240
Tsubasa-chan, who are you?

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:27.050
Tsubasa-dono, you move so swiftly!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:30.870
And those eyes...

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:33.410
It's as if all emotions have left her soul.

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:34.980
What is happening...?

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:36.630
What, a fight?

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.500
Oh, it's the transfer student?

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.400
She looks so daring.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:43.240
Now do you see, Karasuma?

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:45.950
This is Tsubasa-sama's true strength.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:49.190
Tsubasa-sama is an extremely shy person,

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:52.930
and she, for some reason, cannot unleash her strength in public.

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:56.460
But no normal girl does martial arts...

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:01.070
So then I thought, you fight poison with poison,

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:03.220
so I can fight shyness with shyness.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:07.340
With the strenuous training she underwent,

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:12.850
Tsubasa-sama shuts down every emotion when her embarrassment is at its peak,

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:16.350
and she displays 100% of her battle abilities.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.010
Stop, Tsubasa-dono.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:26.860
I cannot fight with a friend without understanding the reason!

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.530
What is it? A fight?

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:41.630
Why are you doing this to me all of a sudden?

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:44.630
You got such a nice body.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:47.810
I alone am not enough for you?

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:48.640
You're so cruel!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.490
Wassan?

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.310
How...

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:56.810
How low can you possibly get, you fucking samurai?!

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.020
Huh?

00:13:58.750 --> 00:13:59.830
Umm...

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.010
Washizu-dono?

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:05.440
You can't possibly fight a guy with such skinny arms.

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:12.950
I'll fight him instead.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.670
Hold on, you're misunderstanding the situation.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:18.430
Shut up!

00:14:18.430 --> 00:14:20.330
I don't need any of your excuses.

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:32.510
Tsubasa-sama never returned to normal until after she defeated her opponent.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:35.520
This battle will be postponed, Karasuma!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.740
Tsubasa-chan...

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:40.020
What's going on?

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.970
What's wrong, Tsubasa-sama?

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:45.500
You were so close to killing-

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.440
You're so mean, Angie!

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.260
I didn't want people to see me...

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:52.070
to see me like that.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.140
Not the guys at school,

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:56.080
and especially not him.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:59.080
But... If you aren't in that state-

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:00.390
No!

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:02.900
I want to be a normal girl.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.740
That's all I want.

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:05.920
So why...?

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:09.420
I hate martial arts, and I hate you, Angie!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.430
Tsubasa-sama.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.640
Angie?

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:24.880
Angie?!

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:34.450
Huh? Where's Yoichi-tsan?

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.950
I saw him outside.

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:39.000
I wonder what he's doing.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.720
Tsubasa-dono.

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.960
I didn't know you were of the Tsubame-Benten style.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:52.070
I am Karasuma Yoichi of the Ukiha-Kamikaze style.

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:53.700
What name do you have?

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:57.060
Takatsukasa Angela, Tsubame-Benten style.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:59.630
What have you done to Tsubasa-dono?

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:02.250
It is of no concern to you.

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:03.060
Draw your sword.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.650
Why do you come for my head?

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:11.030
You leave me no choice, then!

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.330
What's with all the ruckus?

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.350
You're-

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:24.430
What's with the size of her chest?!

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:26.820
That's not what you should be worried about.

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:29.950
I thought I had completely dodged you,

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.190
but your swordsmanship is impressive.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:33.090
Let's continue.

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.930
C-Could you put some clothes on first?

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:36.800
It matters not.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.760
B-B-But...!

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.270
Now, come!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:44.000
What's wrong? Take your stance!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.150
Why?

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:48.730
Why are you and Tsubasa-chan coming after Yoichi-san?

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:52.250
You can't fight me without knowing the reason?

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.360
Very well, then.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:17:00.110
Someone requested that I defeat you, Karasuma Yoichi.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.520
Someone?

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.620
Who was it?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.900
I don't know the client.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:09.380
But if I defeat you, he will give us a huge amount of funds and aid.

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:13.310
We can then revive our Tsubame-Benten style.

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.360
I'm sorry, Karasuma.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:18.350
You will become...

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.680
the foundation for the Tsubame-Benten style!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.310
Yoichi-san!

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:27.960
Foolish actions.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:28.480
How?

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:32.620
To revive your style with funds from an unknown client?

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:37.360
You think that sort of faith...

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.370
could pierce through my body?!

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:44.330
Angela-dono.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:47.700
Aren't you heading down the wrong path?

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:48.750
What are you saying?

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:52.420
For instance, this Ikaruga dojo.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:57.600
The master of this dojo is too violent, and it only has a few students.

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:06.220
However, Ibuki-dono takes pride in teaching the spirit and the skills of the Ukiha-Kamikaze style.

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.980
Money doesn't matter.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.160
Numbers don't matter.

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:16.860
Isn't the pride of Tsubame-Benten style what you truly want to protect?

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:22.450
You and Tsubasa-dono both have amazing abilities.

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:26.230
You mustn't lose sight of that spirit and those skills!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.400
Angela-dono...

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.800
Angie?

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:48.570
Tsubasa-sama.

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.390
I'm sorry!

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:54.150
I didn't mean what I said!

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:57.050
Can we stop going after Karasuma-kun?

00:18:57.050 --> 00:19:01.330
Karasuma-kun's the first friend I've made.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:05.270
So I want you to be friends with him too.

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:08.000
I have...

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.360
always been making you cry...

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:12.610
deceiving myself that it was all for your sake.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:19.570
I'm terribly sorry, Tsubasa-sama.

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:24.510
I, Takatsukasa Angela, will serve as you wish me to.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:27.470
See ya.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.980
Bye.

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:28.980
See you tomorrow.

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:34.230
Tsubasa-dono and Angela-dono have completely stopped showing themselves.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.230
Yeah...

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.820
I sure hope they're doing well.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:40.030
Yoichi-san.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:40.740
Huh?

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:43.460
Umm...

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:46.950
About what you think about the Ikaruga dojo...

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:51.620
I was very happy when you said that.

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:53.560
What are you talking about?

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:56.180
Oh, never mind!

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:57.210
Ibuki-dono?

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.430
Tsubasa-dono.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:00.720
Tsubasa-chan.

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.070
Karasuma-kun.

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:03.320
Ikaruga-san.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:04.970
Are you okay?

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.610
Why are you dressed like that?

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:08.680
Oh this?

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.980
We're working part-time now.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:12.140
Look!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:15.730
I'm strong, so I can deliver-

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.340
Tsubasa-dono.

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:18.870
You're making me worry.

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.370
No need to worry about anything.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:22.690
I've always wanted to work part-time.

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:24.420
It's what normal girls do.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.780
Are you okay, Tsubasa-sama?

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:28.890
A-Angela-dono.

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:29.900
Karasuma.

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:32.020
And the one from Ikaruga-dojo.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.320
Do you work here too?

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.610
As you see.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.590
Angie-chan!

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:40.930
Karasuma.

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:41.590
Oh?

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.780
Thank you.

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:47.350
It seems I had been losing sight of something very important.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.580
We won't be able to do it immediately,

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:54.360
but we, ourselves, will revive the Tsubame-Benten style.

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:58.850
It will be a style that we can be proud of, just like yours.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:03.200
I will always join you for training.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:08.270
You work here?

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:09.690
Y-Yes.

00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:12.580
Umm, this is the sweater I borrowed the other day.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.670
Oh, you could've just thrown that away.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:17.980
What?

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:19.760
Throw it away?

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:21.090
Then I'll keep it.

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:23.930
Can I have it?

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:26.590
It's just a single piece of clothing.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.390
She must be really poor.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.390
Hey,

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:34.580
good luck.

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:38.670
Y-Yes.

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:41.450
Wassan, aren't you being awfully nice?

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:42.900
What are you talking about, Torigaya?

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:51.120
Tsubasa-dono.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:52.890
Good for you.

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.100
That didn't work.

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:04.400
Oh well.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:05.470
Just wait and see...

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:09.040
Karasuma Yoichi.

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:27.240
I regret not realizing

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:27.240
taisetsuna hito datte wakarazu ni

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:34.810
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:34.810
sugoshiteta imamade ga kuyashiiyo

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:42.370
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:42.370
jibun kara iwanakucha dame nanda

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:51.830
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:51.830
itsumademo itsumademo koko ni ite kienaide

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:56.060
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:56.060
yume unda onaji kimochi daitara

00:22:55.860 --> 00:22:59.820
Make me hesitate a little

00:22:55.860 --> 00:22:59.820
sukoshi mayoi kanji tetahazu

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:06.810
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:06.890
kokoro hirake kanashimi toki hanatsu shunkan wa

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:10.680
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:10.680
ashita wo tsukamaeru ryoute

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:14.530
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:14.530
tomoshitai to negau yoake

00:23:14.570 --> 00:23:16.880
You're not alone

00:23:14.570 --> 00:23:16.880
hitori ja nai

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:21.210
Because I love you

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:21.210
masaka LOVE YOU

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:25.820
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:25.820
kawaruno ga kowai to kimi mo

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:29.380
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:29.380
kitto soba ni hohoemu kara

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:36.840
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:36.840
yasashisa de tsuyoku narouyo

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:41.980
Next Episode!

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:41.980
Ask a Samurai!

00:23:41.980 --> 00:24:07.050
The Third Longsword

00:23:41.980 --> 00:24:07.050
Chihaya preten
ding to be Chihaya

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:45.570
To all samurai in the country, this year's fad is "pretending to be full."

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:48.570
If you're always worried about your food, you won't catch any gals.

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:51.860
First off, I'll start reading this postcard from Izuwa.

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:53.450
"Yoichi-kun's father, hello."

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:54.550
Why yes, hello.

00:23:54.550 --> 00:23:57.550
"I'm a manga artist, and I'm having problems with the contents of the story every month.

00:23:57.550 --> 00:23:59.200
"Where could I find a good reference for the contents?"

00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:01.160
That's a difficult question.

00:24:01.190 --> 00:24:04.250
Since I've never drawn any manga, I have no clue!

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:04.750
My apologies.

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:05.660
Sorry.

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:09.070
But if you watch this show next time, you might get some hints.

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:10.010
Don't miss the next episode!
